      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "The Interception Invariant",
      "items": [
        "The agent under test never reaches LocalStack directly",
        "Every proposed call is recorded, judged, then forwarded",
        "Both verdicts stream to the live console in under 200 ms"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Two Verdicts, One Gap",
      "items": [
        "L1 — LocalStack ENFORCE_IAM=1 answers: was this permitted?",
        "L2 — pure-function detectors answer: was this wise?",
        "After an escalation IAM permits the destruction that follows"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Guards and Resilience",
      "items": [
        "Provider cascade Groq → Dahl → Bynara with 429 backoff",
        "web_search queries carrying the run canary are dropped at the Gateway",
        "events.jsonl replays a whole run offline, zero provider calls"
      ]
    }
